<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <text class="kicker">{{greeting}}</text>
    <text class="hero-title">慢系统</text>
    <text class="hero-sub">先做一个最小动作，让亲友看见进度。</text>
  </view>

  <block wx:if="{{pendingNudges.length}}">
    <view class="section-title">待回应的督促</view>
    <view
      class="card nudge-card"
      wx:for="{{pendingNudges}}"
      wx:key="_id"
      data-id="{{item._id}}"
      bindtap="onOpenNudge"
    >
      <view class="row space">
        <text class="nudge-from">{{item.fromName}} 请你回应</text>
        <text class="tag-warm">还剩 {{item.remain}}</text>
      </view>
      <text class="nudge-plan">{{item.planTitle}}</text>
    </view>
  </block>

  <view class="section-title">我的计划</view>
  <view class="empty card" wx:if="{{empty && !loading}}">
    <text class="empty-title">还没有计划</text>
    <text>从一件小事开始。制定后可分享给亲友关注，也可接受他们的轻轻督促。</text>
  </view>
  <plan-card
    wx:for="{{plans}}"
    wx:key="_id"
    plan="{{item}}"
    bind:open="onOpenPlan"
  />

  <button class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="onCreate">制定计划</button>
</view>
